{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Noah, a young boy who grew up in an orphanage, wakes up in an unknown hotel-like bedroom.<br>The door is locked, with not even a keyhole in sight.<br>While cautiously exploring the room, Noah is suddenly struck by dizziness and falls unconscious.<br>He regains consciousness to find an unfamiliar memo pad and a locked box in front of him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>\u201cSorry if I frightened you...! My name is Sally.&quot;<br>&quot;Let's escape together once and for all!\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sally's mysterious powers allow her to somehow enter into Noah's body.<br>According to her, Noah will soon be used as a test subject for research on supernatural powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work with Sally to escape from this facility... Before it is too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679400/extras/3272d806e366bef7c137a0bc3ec909d8.avif?t=1753887717\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679400/extras_big/3272d806e366bef7c137a0bc3ec909d8.avif?t=1753887717 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   This game is a 3D mystery-solving adventure game played from a first-person perspective.<br>The player starts out locked up and must explore the room to find items and documents to solve challenging puzzles in order to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679400/extras/33b19f1dff26e4c24359055bacc2cd14.avif?t=1753887717\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679400/extras_big/33b19f1dff26e4c24359055bacc2cd14.avif?t=1753887717 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hint function available!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   This game contains high-difficulty puzzles.<br>If you get stuck, please use the \u201cHint\u201d option in the Pause Menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679400/extras/9eaf56d5c4000e8aaebc0f96b9c95afe.avif?t=1753887717\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679400/extras_big/9eaf56d5c4000e8aaebc0f96b9c95afe.avif?t=1753887717 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Estimated play time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   2-3 hours</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming Guidelines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   Streaming and monetization of it is allowed without permission, regardless of whether it is for personal or corporate use.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Bad boy!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3679400/431fbe598ad47a8e7e33aa7e8504d404f850373f.jpg"},{"name":"Time to escape!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3679400/1bb9c8dd7c1edb1b58f57c6b883acb96e597e939.jpg"},{"name":"Ouch...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3679400/92b0480e234989012471243ead41d853e27aadaf.jpg"},{"name":"Electrician","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3679400/fa278ead30c09a0bf9892b419a42654582b0eae9.jpg"},{"name":"Mission cleared!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3679400/963bce343544cc9689fb0832223d816dd14c53b5.jpg"},{"name":"Sharpener","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3679400/f19d84e85ce50e5c747db87d16981fee1ce08824.jpg"},{"name":"Oops...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3679400/2700175d80866d89480053d49e7531a0f35bda4b.jpg"},{"name":"UNLOCKER","path":"https://cdn.aka